1
00:00:00,358 --> 00:00:01,298
(Leonard:)It's not a big deal.

2
00:00:01,459 --> 00:00:02,909
(Barry:)It's a huge deal.

3
00:00:03,061 --> 00:00:05,701
(Barry:)Cooper, maybe physics
just isn't your thing.

4
00:00:06,531 --> 00:00:08,741
(Barry:)Have you ever considered
a career in retail?

5
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:11,710
(Barry:)That way you could take
things back for a living.

6
00:00:13,338 --> 00:00:14,548
(Leonard:)Okay, Barry, that's enough.

7
00:00:14,706 --> 00:00:15,916
Oh, no, that's okay.

8
00:00:16,074 --> 00:00:17,914
(Sheldon:)I can fight my own battles.

9
00:00:18,076 --> 00:00:20,746
Isn't that right, "Bawwy"?

10
00:00:23,314 --> 00:00:24,484
(Barry:)Is...?

11
00:00:24,649 --> 00:00:27,219
Is that a reference
to my speech impediment?

12
00:00:28,686 --> 00:00:31,096
That's pretty hurtful.

13
00:00:31,255 --> 00:00:32,525
(Scene:)I...

14
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:34,690
I can't control it.

15
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,070
(Sheldon:)You're right,

16
00:00:37,228 --> 00:00:39,108
(Sheldon:)that was uncalled for.

17
00:00:39,263 --> 00:00:40,533
(Sheldon:)I take it back.

18
00:00:40,698 --> 00:00:41,508
(Barry:)Of course you do.

19
00:00:41,666 --> 00:00:43,666
Because you're the Retractor!

20
00:00:48,039 --> 00:00:50,039
(Bernadette:)Raj, this dinner was amazing.

21
00:00:50,208 --> 00:00:51,188
(Bernadette:)If you're here much longer,

22
00:00:51,342 --> 00:00:53,182
I'm going to have
to buy bigger clothes.

23
00:00:53,344 --> 00:00:54,184
(Sheldon:)Nonsense.

24
00:00:54,345 --> 00:00:55,345
(Raj:)You need a little fattening up.

25
00:00:55,513 --> 00:00:57,223
You've been locking
too skinny lately.

26
00:00:57,415 --> 00:00:58,725
(Sheldon:)Aww.

27
00:00:58,850 --> 00:01:01,230
(Bernadette:)Howie, how come you never
say anything sweet like that?

